  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.3",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Carissimi, omnem sollicitudinem faciens scribendi vobis de communi vestra salute, necesse habui scribere vobis: deprecans supercertari semel traditæ sanctis fidei.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.4",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Subintroierunt enim quidam homines (qui olim præscripti sunt in hoc judicium) impii, Dei nostri gratiam transferentes in luxuriam, et solum Dominatorem, et Dominum nostrum Jesum Christum negantes.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.5",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Commonere autem vos volo, scientes semel omnia, quoniam Jesus populum de terra Ægypti salvans, secundo eos, qui non crediderunt, perdidit:",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.6",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "angelos vero, qui non servaverunt suum principatum, sed dereliquerunt suum domicilium, in judicium magni diei, vinculis æternis sub caligine reservavit.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.7",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sicut Sodoma, et Gomorrha, et finitimæ civitates simili modo exfornicatæ, et abeuntes post carnem alteram, factæ sunt exemplum, ignis æterni pœnam sustinentes.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.8",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Similiter et hi carnem quidem maculant, dominationem autem spernunt, majestatem autem blasphemant.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.9",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cum Michaël Archangelus cum diabolo disputans altercaretur de Moysi corpore, non est ausus judicium inferre blasphemiæ: sed dixit: Imperet tibi Dominus.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.10",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hi autem quæcumque quidem ignorant, blasphemant: quæcumque autem naturaliter, tamquam muta animalia, norunt, in his corrumpuntur.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.11",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Væ illis, quia in via Cain abierunt, et errore Balaam mercede effusi sunt, et in contradictione Core perierunt !",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.12",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hi sunt in epulis suis maculæ, convivantes sine timore, semetipsos pascentes, nubes sine aqua, quæ a ventis circumferentur, arbores autumnales, infructuosæ, bis mortuæ, eradicatæ,",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.13",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "fluctus feri maris, despumantes suas confusiones, sidera errantia: quibus procella tenebrarum servata est in æternum.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.14",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Prophetavit autem et de his septimus ab Adam Enoch, dicens: Ecce venit Dominus in sanctis millibus suis",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/jude#Jude.1.15",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/jude",
    "canonical_ref": "Jude.1.15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "facere judicium contra omnes, et arguere omnes impios de omnibus operibus impietatis eorum, quibus impie egerunt, et de omnibus duris, quæ locuti sunt contra Deum peccatores impii.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
